{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/c3g8aCkDieo5z1LNvVBECg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:37.447413+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/c3g8aCkDieo5z1LNvVBECg","html":"<div><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8ZicBr0oxyibIWbwt4bRe5uOwyujFoRmSmribDUtFQ7M3AJbgJTMarPpUmgIVpHgUhaDzTaXbpEDRibdN6AKicJ5tUQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8ZicBr0oxyibIWbwt4bRe5uOwyujFoRmSmDNUhfAU4CxvzVaZwlzu7ibQfJRI7vDz01pq3f5tOq6BPdycgj8h8NUA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、校企联合培养专项简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8ZicBr0oxyibIWbwt4bRe5uOwyujFoRmSmoHNGTvliaHG0AfggfPfzNvwqTv7aaTNctR2gtckh1u3lwoztv5OjC4g/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>为提高工程硕博士培养质量，加强高校和企业优势互补，促进产学研深度融合，培养一批卓越工程人才和行业领军人才，</span><span><strong><span>北京科技大学-中国五矿于2022年开始进行校企联合培养专项试点，主要面向获得推免资格的应届本科毕业生招收工程硕士和博士研究生。</span></strong></span></p><p><span>专项工程硕、博士研究生在校企双导师（组）指导下，围绕企业工程技术难题和卡脖子技术，以科技攻关项目为抓手，实行工学交替模式，把工程实践有机嵌入学生培养全过程。</span><strong><span><span>硕士生：</span></span></strong><span>学制3年，1年左右在校进行公共课程和专业基础课程学习，2年左右在企业专业实践；</span><strong><span><span>直博生：</span></span></strong><span>学制5年，2年左右在校进行公共课程和专业基础课程学习，3年左右在企业专业实践。入选专项试点的研究生除享受学校的奖助政策外，中国五矿将支付攻读研究生期间的学费，在工程实践阶段，中国五矿将发放生活和学业津贴，提供统一住宿（校内宿舍仍保留）和餐补，购买商业保险等。学生毕业后选择加入中国五矿的，同等条件下优先录用，并根据国家政策，可提前参评专业技术职称等。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、活动简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8ZicBr0oxyibIWbwt4bRe5uOwyujFoRmSmoHNGTvliaHG0AfggfPfzNvwqTv7aaTNctR2gtckh1u3lwoztv5OjC4g/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>夏令营活动拟在</span><strong><span><span>北京（7月22日-24日）、湖南（7月29日-31日）</span></span></strong><span>分两期举行</span><span><span>。夏令营期间将安排营员参观企业先进生产线和实验室、名师讲座、校友互动、联谊交流等。本活动旨在通过营员与一线工程技术</span></span><span>专家的交流，让在校大学生开阔专业视野，感受科研氛围，了解行业前沿，并为校企联合培养专项试点发现有志于在行业建功立业的年轻人才。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>本次夏令营将面向北京科技大学大三（2022级）优秀本科生接收34名左右的营员，将组织“优秀营员”评选活动，为优秀营员颁发证书。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>校企联合培养专业领域包括：</span></span></strong><span>先进试验与测试、关键软件、新材料、人工智能、智慧能源。申请工作自即日开始，本次夏令营活动申请报名和全程均不收费，同时，中国五矿将为营员免费提供往返交通和餐费，购买夏令营期间人身意外险，并为湖南营学生提供免费住宿。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、申请办法</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8ZicBr0oxyibIWbwt4bRe5uOwyujFoRmSmoHNGTvliaHG0AfggfPfzNvwqTv7aaTNctR2gtckh1u3lwoztv5OjC4g/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>（一）申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>1. </span></strong></span><span>北京科技大学本科三年级在校生（2026年应届毕业）。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>2.</span></span></strong><span> 本科专业要求：</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>北京地区营</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8ZicBr0oxyibIWbwt4bRe5uOwyujFoRmSmZGHEK2rWCOzJh1ElpHZnkSiarMBcKrJDYQINJJDMOHnIr9LX7VZns3A/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>湖南地区营</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8ZicBr0oxyibIWbwt4bRe5uOwyujFoRmSmiaOmAmo9ibwicQjkvkiaHocSckwhryv5aVt3U2fL1n0NXTf4AV2AWDBZyA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>3. </span></span></strong><span>本科阶段学习成绩、特别是专业成绩突出，有望获得学院推免资格。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>4.</span></span></strong><span> CET-6成绩425分以上。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>5.</span></span></strong><span> 学风端正，品德良好，有志于扎根工程实践一线服务行业企业。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>（二）报名程序</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>1.报名</span></span></strong></p><p><span>学生应于</span><strong><span><span>6月25日12:00-7月3日12:00登录“北京科技大学研究生报考服务系统”进行报名</span></span></strong><span>，</span><strong><span><span>网址：http://yjsy.ustb.edu.cn/ksxt/logon</span></span></strong><span>，招生项目选择“2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营”，注册账号后，使用系统分配的报名号作为用户名，注册时设定的密码登录系统，院系选择“500中国五矿”，在报名截止日期前按照系统提示填写个人信息和上传材料。个人信息填写完毕，按要求上传材料后，其中《北京科技大学全国优秀大学生夏令营申请表》需从系统中下载后到学院签字盖章后再上传，材料上传完成确认提交。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>注意：</span></span></strong><span>在申请信息填写页，专项计划应选择“工程硕博士联合培养专项”，校内专项计划应选择“无”，招生类型目前均选择“硕士”，后续正式招生时根据下达计划再确定最终的招生类型。每名同学只能在北京地区营和湖南地区营之间选择一个参加。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>2.营员资格获得</span></span></strong></p><p><span>管理员将在7月3日-4日对申请者材料进行集中审核，申请者应在此期间及时登录系统查看审核结果（入围、未入围、申请退回）。如对审核结果为申请退回，申请者应按照管理员提示修改后重新上传材料并提交。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>夏令营的材料审核及营员招收工作将在7月4日结束。入围营员名单将于7月8日前在学校研究生招生信息网上公布。</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、活动安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8ZicBr0oxyibIWbwt4bRe5uOwyujFoRmSmoHNGTvliaHG0AfggfPfzNvwqTv7aaTNctR2gtckh1u3lwoztv5OjC4g/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>北京地区营</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8ZicBr0oxyibIWbwt4bRe5uOwyujFoRmSmhIlliaQOCGbapMb51oXZHIG5ib3yA2T5gBibRXskuIhJSOiaQYZmeUFiaTQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>湖南地区营</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8ZicBr0oxyibIWbwt4bRe5uOwyujFoRmSmxyP8nhGwYMq6ibNHk0nUKDjD8jGzwGMOFDxODCwcz5GkqOcia9OslibVQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>具体安排以实际为准，营员名单公布后将通过短信或电话通知后续安排。</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8ZicBr0oxyibIWbwt4bRe5uOwyujFoRmSmoHNGTvliaHG0AfggfPfzNvwqTv7aaTNctR2gtckh1u3lwoztv5OjC4g/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>学校研招办公室咨询电话：</span></span></strong><span><span>010-62332484</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>联 系 人：</span></span></strong><span>刘老师、李老师</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>学校国家卓越工程师学院校企合作办公室咨询电话：</span></span></strong><span>010-62334954</span></p><p><strong><span><span>联 系 人：</span></span></strong><span>孟老师</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>企业人力资源部咨询电话：</span></span></strong><span>010-6016</span><span><span>9780</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>联 系 人：</span></span></strong><span>牛老师</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>六、其他事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8ZicBr0oxyibIWbwt4bRe5uOwyujFoRmSmoHNGTvliaHG0AfggfPfzNvwqTv7aaTNctR2gtckh1u3lwoztv5OjC4g/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>1. </span></span></strong><span>学生须承诺所有申报材料和信息均属实，如有弄虚作假，一经查实，取消本人参营资格。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>2.</span></span></strong><span> 营员报到时需携带本人身份证及学生证。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>3. </span></span></strong><span>营员报到时，学院与营员需签署《夏令营活动安全协议》。开营后要求营员全程参加夏令营活动，并严格遵守企业相关安全管理规定。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>北京科技大学  中国五矿集团有限公司</span></p><p><span>2025年6月24日</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>附件：夏令营申请材料清单</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>1.身份证。</span></span></strong><span>本人有效身份证正、反面，制作在一页PDF上。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>2.学生证。</span></span></strong><span>本人学生证照片，有本人照片，注册页注册齐全，所有页面制作在一页PDF上。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>3.成绩单。</span></span></strong><span>本人1-6学期成绩单，需有学校教务部门公章或者成绩专用章。扫描为1个PDF文件。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>4.夏令营申请表。</span></span></strong><span>本表格在系统报名提交信息时生成，可在申请时下载打印，表格中成绩排名证明处须有分管本科教学院长签名并加盖学院公章。扫描为1个PDF文件。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>5.外语水平证明。</span></span></strong><span>大学四、六级成绩单或雅思、GRE等成绩单等。如有多个文件，请合并至1个PDF中。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>6.获奖或创新成果等。</span></span></strong><span>本人在本科阶段所获荣誉、奖学金获奖证明、参加竞赛、创新创业项目等获奖证明，发表论文、获得专利等证明材料，如有多个文件，请合并至1个PDF中。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section> </section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong>NEWS</strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section> </section></section></section><section><p>转自丨北科研招</p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/8ZicBr0oxyibIWbwt4bRe5uOwyujFoRmSmxdxzd1YM7X9HZb1t6GUjaHVy8bLTK4bRhmngEZEoyjFAvysASJmS0w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"442ce963b7b76f20e49a2df8723b4aaea424672ec61d9639510aac7d9b3ff1cf","textLength":2108,"sourceSha256":"50cbe4122db54153c4ca77ff547be2f76273635fdb83438014d55ad1f93ddef0","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-be84975afbb285b8de6a","title":"2025年北京科技大学卓越工程师学院中国五矿集团有限公司2025年校企联合培养专项优秀大学生夏令营活动","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:37.447413+00:00"}
